STEP 8 — IMPLEMENT CROSS-SYSTEM COMMUNICATION

The systems must react to each other.

Example emergency scenario:

If smoke is detected in the garden system:

Garden ESP32 publishes

system/fire_alert = TRUE

Home ESP32 subscribes to this topic.

When it receives the message:

Open the house door automatically.

Garage ESP32 also subscribes.

When message received:

Open garage door automatically.

This ensures emergency evacuation.

